{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Recommended rest seconds golden cases run by Android RestDurationGoldenTest and iOS RestDurationGoldenTests. restSeconds is the role-based rest for the exercise resolved from name (Primary 180, Secondary 120, Isolation 75, Core and Warmup 60; unknown or custom exercises count as Isolation 75). catalogKey, when present, is the catalog key of the same exercise: iOS also passes it alongside the name, Android resolves from the name alone. restLimits is the canonical active-rest bound on both platforms: configured rest is valid from minSeconds to maxSeconds inclusive, and adjust (+/-) from a running rest of remainingSeconds by deltaSeconds gives expectedSeconds (0 stops the rest; a result between 1 and minSeconds-1 is raised to minSeconds; a result above maxSeconds is lowered to maxSeconds).",
